  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "綠色會計",
    "sub_ename": "GREEN ACCOUNTING",
    "describe_ch": "投資人對永續環境議題的重視，使得企業社會責任報告書的重要性將逐漸與財務報表並駕齊驅。企業不能像過去一樣單純以利潤最大化為目標，須進一步考慮對環境及社會之外部成本與效益。綠色會計除了從傳統會計角度出發，亦會涉及其他跨領域知識。本課程介紹綠色會計、企業社會責任、碳足跡、碳稅等相關議題，幫助學生了解如何將環境及社會等外部成本內部化，以因應企業的需要。",
    "describe_eh": "In recent years, investors are interested in sustainable and environmental issues, raising the importance of corporate social responsibility (CSR) reports and as important as traditional financial statements. Companies aim at maximum profits in the past. However, they consider the costs and benefits on environment and society. This course introduces related subjects of green accounting, including green accounting, corporate social responsibility (CSR), carbon footprint, and carbon taxes. This course helps students understand green accounting and apply them to internalize of environment costs.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "1. 了解企業社會責任之相關知識；分析及應用綠色會計之觀念\r\n2. 從環境與會計角度分析問題\r\n",
      "describe_en": "1. Knowledge for the contents of CSR ; Comprehension for the application of green accounting\r\n2. Analyzation from environmental and accounting field\r\n"
    }
